and the one in the wheelchair, I'd stay clear.

325
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:19,180
这只是个误会
This is just a misunderstanding.

326
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:21,100
里科对我不感兴趣
Rico's not interested in me.

327
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:23,300
他昨晚看着挺喜欢你的呀
Well, he seemed pretty into you last night.

328
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,640
是啊 但那是在她开口说话前
Huh, yeah, but that's before she talked.

329
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:30,950
拜托 我们对你们的男人完全不感兴趣
Come on, we are not interested in your men at all.

330
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:34,060
完全不来电 拜托 动动脑好吗
Not at all. I mean, come on.

331
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,300
这话什么意思
What's that mean?

332
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,640
你是说他们有问题吗
You're saying something's wrong with them?

333
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:42,140
不 她不是那个意思 只是...
No, she's not saying that. It's just--

334
00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:43,640
只是什么
It's just what?

335
00:16:45,640 --> 00:16:47,020
我们才是一对
We're lovers.

336
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:54,640
你们俩是一对 你们俩看着一点也不...
You two are lovers? 'Cause you don't seem--

337
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,400
我们看着不什么 不像拉拉吗
We don't seem what? Gay?

338
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,680
不 是不够正
No. Hot enough.

339
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:03,420
这个嘛
Well--

340
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:04,580
一点儿也不正
Not hot at all.

341
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:06,580
可不是嘛
I know, right?

342
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,500
快四处看 睁大你的眼睛
Look busy, keep your eyes open.

343
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:12,460
我想我们已经深入野兽之腹了
I think we're in the belly of the beast.

344
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:13,980
你们在说我吗
You talkin' about me?

345
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,180
没有
No.

346
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:25,260
麦克斯 你觉得那扇上锁的门后面是什么
Max, what do you think's behind that locked door?

347
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,820
我就知道 小童工们
I knew it! Toddler slaves.

348
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:30,520
那些孩子生活在巨大的危险之中
Those kids are in horrible danger

349
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:32,981
很可能以后会变成... 我
of becoming...me.

350
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:35,480
快 咱们去那边看看
Come on, let's go over there.

351
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:40,800
搞什么 你打我
What the-- you hit me!

352
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:42,620
抱歉抱歉 这是意外
Sorry, so sorry. Accident!

353
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:45,220
你扔东西像个娘们一样
You throw like a girl.

354
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,200
我就知道 你们俩不是拉拉
See, I knew it, you two aren't gay.

355
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:50,340
你们俩是想抢我们的男人
Yous are after our guys!

356
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,600
不是的 只是里科觉得我
No, I'm not! Rico just thought I was

357
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,840
真的真的真的很漂亮
really, really, really pretty.

358
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:57,720
你好大的狗胆
Oh, hell no!

359
00:17:58,020 --> 00:17:59,020
不许欺负我的妞
Leave my lover alone!

360
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,500
开战吧
It's on!

361
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:07,660
别别别 别开战
It's--no, no, no, no, no! It's not on.

362
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:09,560
这太傻了 我们不是来抢男人的
This is silly. We're not after anyone.

363
00:18:09,620 --> 00:18:10,700
我们是来帮助那些在这工...
we're here to help some of those work--

364
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:14,760
没错 现在正式开战
Oh, yeah. Now, it's on!

365
00:18:15,676 --> 00:18:17,144
我警告你
Oh! I warn you!

366
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:23,020
你个死胖子
Oh, hell no!

367
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:28,280
不许过来 贱货
Back off, bitch!

368
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:31,360
你喊谁贱货 贱货
Who you calling bitch, bitch?

369
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:39,520
亲爱的 你有点玩过头了哦
Honey? You're getting carried away.

370
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,220
现在你真的是被人举过头了
Now you're really getting carried away.

371
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:45,020
不要 别把我放进烘干机
Oh, no! Don't put me in the dryer!

372
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:47,120
我以前是有钱人啊 只能干洗
I used to be rich, I'm dry clean only!

373
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:01,140
你真他妈是找死
That was a big friggin' mistake!

374
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:07,680
向你们致敬
Respect.

375
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:09,940
你们俩的战斗力
You two are a lot tougher

376
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:11,460
比圣布里吉特的学生妹强多了
than those girls from Saint Bridget's.

377
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,500
这是怎么回事
What's happening?

378
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:20,540
我们来举发你的恶行 我们知道你干的勾当
We're busting you. We know what's happening here.

379
00:19:20,820 --> 00:19:22,260
什么 分红制度和医疗保险吗
What, profit sharing and healthcare?

380
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:28,120
我们在盒子里发现一张潦草地写着"帮帮我们"的纸条
We found a note in our box with "Help us" scrawled on it.

381
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:29,097
你该作何解释
How do you explain that?

382
00:19:29,097 --> 00:19:31,193
你有看背面吗
Did you read the back?

383
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:34,380
"帮帮我们
"Help us..

384
00:19:37,020 --> 00:19:38,460
也是帮帮你自己
Help you...

385
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:41,080
在美国王牌发挥你全方位的潜力"
to your full potential at American Ace."

386
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:44,720
我们在每一个盒子里都放了一张
We put one in every box we ship.

387
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:47,780
看来以后我得开始学习看字不能光看第一句
I have got to start reading more than the first sentence of stuff.

388
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:55,020
对不起 这都是我的错
I'm sorry, this is all my fault.

389
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,300
我只是一厢情愿地希望
I guess I just wanted to believe

390
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:58,960
有些孩子的童年会过得比我悲惨
some kids were having a worse childhood than I was.

391
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:03,500
麦克斯 别内疚 你以为有人需要帮助
Max, don't feel bad. You thought someone needed help,

392
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:05,560
而你关心他们 这说明你是个好人
and you cared, and that makes you a good person,

393
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:06,580
我为你感到骄傲
and I'm proud of you.

394
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:08,640
我都道歉了 你不用这么刻薄吧
I said I was sorry. You don't have to be mean.

395
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:11,640
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

396
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:16,720
我第一批假发到货了
I just got my first shipment of wigs.

397
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:22,720
苏菲 你干嘛走路姿势怪怪的
Sophie, why are you walking like that?

398
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,420
我不光是老板
Well, I'm not just the president,

399
00:20:25,840 --> 00:20:27,520
我也是用户啊
I'm also a client.

400
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,720
苏菲 你好像有东西掉了
Sophie, I think you dropped something,

401
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:38,520
除非我看走眼 是巨型波斯蟑螂又出现了
unless we have those giant Persian roaches again.

402
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:43,180
那画面就连白内障的我也觉得不忍直视
Even a milky version of that was too much.

403
00:20:51,180 --> 00:20:54,160
麦克斯 或许某天会有一个像你这样的人
You know, Max, maybe someday, someone like you will come

404
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:56,780
冲进这家沙门氏菌工厂 把咱俩救出去
into this Salmonella factory and rescue us.

405
00:20:57,300 --> 00:20:58,860
你在支票后面写什么啊
What are you writing on those checks?

406
00:20:59,160 --> 00:20:59,700
"帮帮我们"
"Help us."

407
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:03,740
我们在这里工作就暗示着"我们需要帮助"啊
We work here. The "Help us" is implied.
